[
  {
    "text": "每次出差旅行",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 1.206,
    "duration": 1.206
  },
  {
    "text": "是不是都在为带哪个吹风机发愁",
    "start_time": 1.206,
    "end_time": 4.022,
    "duration": 2.815
  },
  {
    "text": "酒店的吹风机",
    "start_time": 4.022,
    "end_time": 5.228,
    "duration": 1.206
  },
  {
    "text": "风小还伤发",
    "start_time": 5.228,
    "end_time": 6.233,
    "duration": 1.005
  },
  {
    "text": "我真的会谢",
    "start_time": 6.233,
    "end_time": 7.239,
    "duration": 1.005
  },
  {
    "text": "还好被我挖到了这个出差神器",
    "start_time": 7.239,
    "end_time": 9.853,
    "duration": 2.614
  },
  {
    "text": "它折起来就比手机大一点点",
    "start_time": 9.853,
    "end_time": 12.266,
    "duration": 2.413
  },
  {
    "text": "放包里",
    "start_time": 12.266,
    "end_time": 12.869,
    "duration": 0.603
  },
  {
    "text": "行李箱里巨省地方",
    "start_time": 12.869,
    "end_time": 14.478,
    "duration": 1.609
  },
  {
    "text": "别看它小",
    "start_time": 14.478,
    "end_time": 15.282,
    "duration": 0.804
  },
  {
    "text": "11万转的风力可不是盖的",
    "start_time": 15.282,
    "end_time": 17.695,
    "duration": 2.413
  },
  {
    "text": "我这长头发",
    "start_time": 17.695,
    "end_time": 18.7,
    "duration": 1.005
  },
  {
    "text": "几分钟就搞定了",
    "start_time": 18.7,
    "end_time": 20.108,
    "duration": 1.408
  },
  {
    "text": "而且它这个屏显调温我真的超爱",
    "start_time": 20.108,
    "end_time": 22.923,
    "duration": 2.815
  },
  {
    "text": "想要什么温度自己调",
    "start_time": 22.923,
    "end_time": 24.732,
    "duration": 1.81
  },
  {
    "text": "清清楚楚",
    "start_time": 24.732,
    "end_time": 25.537,
    "duration": 0.804
  },
  {
    "text": "经常出门的姐妹",
    "start_time": 25.537,
    "end_time": 26.944,
    "duration": 1.408
  },
  {
    "text": "这个颜值高又强悍的小东西",
    "start_time": 26.944,
    "end_time": 29.357,
    "duration": 2.413
  },
  {
    "text": "必须焊在你的行李箱里",
    "start_time": 29.357,
    "end_time": 31.368,
    "duration": 2.011
  }
]